  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#haymarket">Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market</placeName><lb/>
               This Evening, <date when="1811-09-23">Monday, September 23, 1811</date><lb/>
               Will be perform'd a Comedy in Three Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_birth_day"><hi rend="allcaps">Birth-Day.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Captain Bertram,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_sh_mu">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Munden</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mr. Bertram,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ed_ey">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Eyre</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Harry Bertram,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cooper">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Circuit,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_grove">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Jack Junk,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mallinson">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Emma,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_bellchambers">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mrs. Moral,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_grove">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Anne,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_kendall">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Kendall</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               With a Farce in Two Acts, call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_fortunes_frolick">Fortune's Frolick.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Robin Rough-head,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mallinson">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Snacks,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_martin">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Frank,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cooper">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Rattle,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_r_jones">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Hodge,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mi">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Miss Nancy,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_decamp">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Margery,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_grove">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Dolly,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which will be produced, <hi rend="allcaps">A New Farce</hi>, in Two Acts, call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_darkness_visible">Darkness Visible.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With New Scenery, Dresses, and Decorations,<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_jones">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_th_ru">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Russell</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_grove">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cooper">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_noble">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_finn">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mi">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_widdicombe">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_gray">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Gray</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_sh_mu">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Munden</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_decamp">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_watson">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The Doors to be Open'd at <time when="18:00:00">Six o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="19:00:00">Seven</time>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">First Price. Second Price.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi>,---<measure type="currency">Six Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">Three Shillings</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi>,---<measure type="currency">Three Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">One Shilling and Sixpence</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi>, <measure type="currency">Two Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">One Shilling</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Upper Gallery</hi>, <measure type="currency">One Shilling</measure>. - <measure type="currency">Sixpence</measure>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mas">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi></persName> at the Theatre.<lb/>
               The Publick is respectfully inform'd, that, on this, and every Evening, for the<lb/>
               remainder of the Season, the Doors will be open'd at <time when="17:30:00">Half Past Five</time>, and the Per-<lb/>
               formances begin at <time when="18:30:00">Half Past Six</time> precisely.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
</TEI>
